WEBVTT

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
Burst Mode

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
The Power that Exceeds Ultimate

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:07.560
Burst Mode!

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:09.550
The Power that Exceeds Ultimate!

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:14.320
Carrying Agumon's Digiegg on his back,

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:16.740
Masaru raced towards the final match.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:22.160
Tohma!

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:27.730
Tohma!

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:27.730
Tohma!

00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:43.030
Full Moon Blaster!

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:45.410
What?

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:45.410
What?

00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:51.010
Although the team made peace with Tohma,

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:54.010
they fell before Belphemon's frenzied demonstration of devastating power,

00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:56.680
after he absorbed Kurata's consciousness.

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:05.530
Digisoul Charge!

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:06.930
Overdrive!

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:09.320
Falcomon, evolve!

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:27.920
Ravemon!

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:33.840
With Tohma and Ikuto's struggles in vain,

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:35.800
their comrades were wounded one after another.

00:01:40.110 --> 00:01:41.390
"I want to fight with you."

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:45.440
When Masaru's strong feelings reached Agumon,

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:47.990
his Digiegg finally hatched.

00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:00.660
Agumon... was reborn!

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:05.110
Here we go, Kurata!

00:02:14.810 --> 00:02:16.190
Agu...mon?

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:19.170
Agumon... is back!

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:31.140
Aniki, I'm going ahead!

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:32.470
You jerk!

00:02:34.850 --> 00:02:36.360
Aniki!

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:37.070
Yeah!

00:02:38.710 --> 00:02:41.110
But even if Agumon is back, it won't...

00:02:41.110 --> 00:02:42.590
You're wrong.

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:46.050
We're a team!

00:02:46.570 --> 00:02:48.580
When things we did individually were impossible,

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:51.040
we overcame them all by putting our strengths together!

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:53.130
When together with everyone...

00:02:53.130 --> 00:02:55.080
power gushes out!

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:02.340
No matter how bad the times were...

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:05.550
we were able to pull ourselves through it somehow.

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:08.090
And now...

00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:11.180
All of the scattered puzzle pieces have joined to form a perfect picture!

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:14.140
My body... can still move!

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:16.990
That's right. I can still...

00:03:16.990 --> 00:03:17.860
clench my fists!

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:19.480
Now that I think about it...

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:21.650
You're right. In that case...

00:03:21.650 --> 00:03:22.280
Yeah!

00:03:22.690 --> 00:03:24.110
Just like always...

00:03:24.110 --> 00:03:26.240
We've got you covered!

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:34.670
Master! Your orders!

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:36.930
I think you already know.

00:03:38.090 --> 00:03:39.130
Yes, Master!

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:56.280
Double Crescent Mirage!

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:57.730
Blast Wing!

00:03:58.150 --> 00:03:59.830
Roses Rapier!

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:17.480
How you feelin', Agumon?

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:19.160
The best!

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:21.420
I feel more and more power surging in me!

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:24.420
All right! Then let's go!

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:29.700
Digisoul Charge!

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:30.940
Overdrive!

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:33.450
Agumon, evolve!

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:54.830
ShineGreymon!

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:05.310
Let's go, guys!

00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:06.760
Yeah!

00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:06.760
Yeah!

00:06:18.130 --> 00:06:19.490
Brother...

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:22.510
Don't worry. He's not alone.

00:06:22.510 --> 00:06:23.710
Mister Yushima?

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:25.500
They're a team.

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:27.490
The strongest team in DATS.

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:29.310
It'll be all right.

00:06:29.310 --> 00:06:30.890
I'm sure they'll be fine.

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:37.230
Masaru-niichan...

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:46.370
Rosemon and MirageGaogamon, circle to the left!

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:49.400
ShineGreymon and Ravemon!

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:52.500
Turn around to the right and divert Belphemon's attention!

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:56.320
Double Crescent Mirage!

00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:57.620
Thorn Whip!

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:01.920
Rook and BishopChessmon!

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:03.920
Commit yourselves to background support!

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:14.180
Shining Blast!

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:21.310
All right!

00:07:22.260 --> 00:07:23.810
W-Wow...

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:25.020
What's going on?

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:29.700
ShineGreymon's speed and power are far greater than what they used to be!

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:33.490
Not bad.

00:07:33.490 --> 00:07:34.450
Well, I'm beat.

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:35.950
We can do this.

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:37.670
As long as we keep this up, Belphemon is...

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:46.250
What is that horrible screaming?

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:47.330
Look!

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:56.880
What is that?!

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:57.890
Kurata.

00:07:58.510 --> 00:08:00.440
Hate... hate...

00:08:00.440 --> 00:08:02.310
HATE!!!

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:07.310
Daimon...!

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:09.570
DAIMON...!

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:12.020
In the past, it was Daimon Suguru

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:15.570
and now it's his son, Daimon Masaru...

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:22.460
Why... Why do you stand in my way and thwart my goals, my dreams?!

00:08:23.420 --> 00:08:27.960
Why do you, as father and son, continue to stand before me?!

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:30.320
If only you two weren't around...!

00:08:30.520 --> 00:08:32.550
If only you two weren't around...!

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:38.090
I would have easily been able to rise to the top of the world!!!

00:08:38.090 --> 00:08:40.130
Shut the hell up.

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:45.000
You did all of this for a puny reason like that?

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.100
Puny?

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:49.030
I don't care what happened in the past.

00:08:49.030 --> 00:08:51.430
Those small-time ambitions of yours...

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:53.590
This Daimon Masaru-sama...

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:55.110
will squash them flat!

00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:59.820
D-D-DAIMON!!!

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:11.690
Ravemon!

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:12.350
Ikuto!

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:14.450
Castle Wall!

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:20.850
Are you all right?

00:09:20.850 --> 00:09:22.240
Thank you, Yoshino.

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:23.010
Where's Ravemon?

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:29.380
What the...?

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:30.480
There's something wrong with him!

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:35.490
Has Kurata's consciousness restrained Belphemon again?

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:37.960
I won't allow this!

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:40.370
I won't allow this!

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:41.230
This is...?

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:42.660
What is this?

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:45.010
The city's lights...

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:55.170
He's sucking it up...

00:09:55.170 --> 00:09:56.090
What?

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:59.380
He's sucking up the city's energy!

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:01.880
The city's...

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:02.350
Power!

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:04.520
You guys! Break these chains quick...!

00:10:05.350 --> 00:10:05.930
Tohma!

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:07.770
Don't mind me!

00:10:07.770 --> 00:10:08.850
Hurry and smash those chains!

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:10.650
That's...!

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:13.000
DATS's logistics support vehicle!

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:18.460
Space-time...

00:10:18.460 --> 00:10:19.680
Oscillation bombs!

00:10:20.030 --> 00:10:21.850
What are you going to do, Kurata?!

00:10:30.010 --> 00:10:31.750
IT'S SHOWTIME!

00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:42.140
What?

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:51.980
Kurata...!

00:11:01.110 --> 00:11:01.910
What's that?

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:09.460
Belphemon's attack swept that far...!

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:11.580
Mister, is my brother all right?

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:12.770
Is my brother all right?!

00:11:14.990 --> 00:11:15.670
Everyone...

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:17.340
Don't die.

00:11:24.790 --> 00:11:25.850
What's going on?!

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:36.060
At this rate, we can't even get close to him!

00:11:36.400 --> 00:11:37.560
Hate...

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:39.040
HATE...!

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:49.410
Damn it, Kurata...

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:52.300
I can't believe he went this far.

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:54.990
What's going on, Tohma?

00:11:54.990 --> 00:11:56.920
Yeah, what is that?!

00:11:57.280 --> 00:11:59.550
It's the effect of the space-time oscillation bombs, right?

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:01.990
The bombs?

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:02.800
Yeah.

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:08.650
There's no doubt that he has the ability to absorb energy.

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:12.500
Consuming the city's energy made him bigger.

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:14.560
And now...

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:20.070
By taking in the space-time oscillation bombs, he's capable of ripping open space-time, too!

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:21.900
Master, your orders!

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:25.810
All of you fall away from Belphemon and concentrate on evasion tactics!

00:12:25.810 --> 00:12:26.340
Rog-!

00:12:27.860 --> 00:12:29.450
What do you think you're doing, Tohma?

00:12:29.920 --> 00:12:31.160
Don't you get it?!

00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:34.680
The tear he made in space-time is gradually widening!

00:12:34.680 --> 00:12:36.410
Even under normal circumstances,

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:41.340
the wall that separates space-time in this area has been weakening considerably because of frequent connection with the Digital Gate!

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:46.800
Then...!

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:48.240
Yes...

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:51.020
We can't let Belphemon continue attacking any longer.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:54.670
In our worst-case scenario,

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:59.610
this may cause the Earth and the Digital World to collide with each other and crumble to pieces!

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:03.010
No way!

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:05.130
So what you're saying is...

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:07.910
We just have to hurry up and beat that guy, right?

00:13:08.770 --> 00:13:12.240
Ever since the beginning, I knew there would be trouble.

00:13:12.570 --> 00:13:15.710
But what we have to do... hasn't changed a bit!

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:17.460
Well, that's true.

00:13:18.090 --> 00:13:19.700
It's just like Masaru says!

00:13:19.700 --> 00:13:20.960
I must admit, it is.

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:23.110
You're right.

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:24.720
What we have to do...

00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:26.060
hasn't changed at all!

00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:27.130
All right!

00:13:27.810 --> 00:13:29.220
Get back into position!

00:13:29.880 --> 00:13:32.560
Our offense will center on ShineGreymon, who's the least wounded!

00:13:33.010 --> 00:13:36.190
We'll finish him in one strike to prevent any more damages!

00:13:36.190 --> 00:13:37.300
Yes, Master!

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:41.080
I won't...

00:13:41.080 --> 00:13:42.900
let you do that!

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:50.870
MirageGaogamon!

00:13:50.870 --> 00:13:53.030
Let us deal with the chains.

00:13:53.030 --> 00:13:54.410
You only need to focus on Belphemon!

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:56.820
We'll create an opening for you.

00:13:56.820 --> 00:13:58.110
Take care of the rest!

00:13:58.110 --> 00:13:58.620
Okay!

00:14:01.510 --> 00:14:02.160
Let's go!

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:05.190
Double Crescent Mirage!

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:10.130
Ame-no-ohabari!

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:16.500
RookChessmon!

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:17.730
BishopChessmon!

00:14:17.780 --> 00:14:19.770
Use all of your power to stop him!

00:14:17.780 --> 00:14:19.770
Use all of your power to stop him!

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:25.620
Forbidden Temptation!

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:33.900
Can you still go on, Ravemon?

00:14:33.900 --> 00:14:35.740
Yeah! I'm at full power!

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:41.920
Wh-Wha...?!

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:53.390
Go, ShineGreymon!

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:55.660
Glorious Burst!

00:14:56.730 --> 00:14:59.490
Why is it so big?!

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:07.750
All right!

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:11.650
Did we get him?

00:15:18.720 --> 00:15:19.590
Wha-?!

00:15:19.590 --> 00:15:20.290
No way!

00:15:20.970 --> 00:15:24.990
Even after that attack, not only is he still standing, but he's completely unharmed!

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:28.960
My ambitions...!

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:32.130
I won't let anyone stop them!

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:44.970
BishopChessmon!

00:15:44.970 --> 00:15:46.240
RookChessmon!

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:50.000
Oh no!

00:15:51.610 --> 00:15:54.200
My supremacy is bottomless! Bottomless!

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:01.050
Yoshino-san! Ikuto!

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:02.990
His power is too great!

00:16:03.820 --> 00:16:04.990
At this rate...

00:16:04.990 --> 00:16:05.980
Not yet!

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:10.190
I'll never give up until I punch him out!

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:10.760
Masaru!

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:13.420
Kurata!

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:15.930
Daimon...!

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:21.340
I will be the one who knocks you down!

00:16:21.340 --> 00:16:24.110
Me, Daimon Masaru-sama!

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:26.880
DAIMON MASARU!

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:31.410
Aniki!

00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:40.670
You guys...

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:41.700
Why...?

00:16:43.530 --> 00:16:46.290
I won't overlook a friend... who's in danger!

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:49.980
Don't be so cold.

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:52.170
At least let us take care of this much!

00:16:55.220 --> 00:16:57.430
Maybe... because it's in my blood.

00:17:08.850 --> 00:17:10.760
SHINEGREYMON!

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:11.970
Lend me...!

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:12.780
Lend me...!

00:17:13.390 --> 00:17:18.860
Lend me the power to save my friends and this world!!

00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:20.970
Aniki, that's wrong.

00:17:22.650 --> 00:17:25.590
I know because we've always fought together.

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:29.000
Power isn't something that is borrowed or given.

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:35.410
Yeah, you're right.

00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:38.800
Power isn't something that is borrowed... or given...

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:40.330
Power...

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:42.010
is combined.

00:17:42.360 --> 00:17:44.810
Right, ShineGreymon?

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:54.480
Here it comes!

00:17:55.540 --> 00:17:58.260
We will defeat Kurata.

00:17:58.260 --> 00:17:59.600
We will protect the world...

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:01.390
And our friends...

00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:08.630
Th-Th-This light...!

00:18:08.840 --> 00:18:11.050
Hold your hand over that light!

00:18:08.840 --> 00:18:11.050
{onkei: dakara, nande shitteirun da yo \-A-} {Splash: HE KNOWS BECAUSE HE HAS RECEIVED THE ENLIGHTENMENT OF LOVE!!!!!!! ...Yeah, huh? I don't get it either~ XD}

00:18:11.050 --> 00:18:11.790
Masaru!

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:12.960
Let's go.

00:18:13.380 --> 00:18:14.320
Yeah.

00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:18.310
Charge!

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:23.570
Digisoul Burst!

00:18:27.740 --> 00:18:30.310
You've mastered it well, Daimon Masaru!

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:32.940
And you, ShineGreymon!

00:18:32.940 --> 00:18:38.310
By merging your feelings into one and fiercely igniting your strongest Digisoul,

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:42.560
you have gained supreme power that exceeds the Ultimate Level.

00:18:43.860 --> 00:18:45.240
That is...

00:18:45.240 --> 00:18:47.360
The true Burst Mode!

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:50.580
ShineGreymon!

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:52.250
Burst Mode!

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:06.940
DAIMON!

00:19:22.480 --> 00:19:25.160
I won't allow this!

00:19:41.730 --> 00:19:42.710
Stay away from me!

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:46.390
Stay away!

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:49.260
This will finish you, Kurata!

00:19:53.190 --> 00:19:58.680
<b>mou nani mo nai sekai ja kandou dekinai</b>

00:19:53.190 --> 00:19:58.680
<b>A world that's full of nothing can't inspire anyone</b>

00:19:58.480 --> 00:20:00.260
Go, Masaru!

00:19:58.680 --> 00:20:03.640
<b>sou, kizuita sono hi kara wakaru no sa</b>

00:19:58.680 --> 00:20:03.640
<b>You'll understand what I mean after the day you realize that</b>

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:03.230
Do it for the Digimon who were victimized!

00:20:03.230 --> 00:20:06.390
For everyone who suffered under Kurata!

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:05.750
<b>furue wo tomete</b>

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:05.750
<b>Stop your trembling</b>

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:09.370
<b>hitomi wo hirake</b>

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:09.370
<b>Open your eyes</b>

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:07.110
Masaru!

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:07.110
Masaru!

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:07.990
Masaru!

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:07.990
Masaru!

00:20:09.370 --> 00:20:14.180
<b>kimi no jikan wo tokihanate!</b>

00:20:09.370 --> 00:20:14.180
<b>And liberate your time!</b>

00:20:11.340 --> 00:20:15.170
D-D-...Daimon Masaru!!!

00:20:15.890 --> 00:20:18.140
<b>mirai e Shootin' star!</b>

00:20:15.890 --> 00:20:18.140
<b>Oh shootin' star to the future!</b>

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:19.840
KURATA!

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:21.430
<b>hikari no aachi egake</b>

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:21.430
<b>Draw an arch of light</b>

00:20:21.430 --> 00:20:26.700
<b>todoku no sa shinjitsuzukeru naraba</b>

00:20:21.430 --> 00:20:26.700
<b>As long as you keep believing, it'll reach up there</b>

